                "text": "Today, SCOTUS ruled that states can choose to defund Planned Parenthood through Medicaid and that individual patients do not have a private right to sue the state to stop it.\n\nThis is a major victory for states' rights, the rule of law, and the ongoing fight to ensure that taxpayer dollars are never used to support the abortion industry.",
