                "text": "During my time in Congress I\u2019ve had the opportunity to visit with leaders of our hospitals and medical groups across Wyoming. In response to the needs of our rural state, I proudly supported provisions in the One Big Beautiful Bill Act allocating funds to support rural healthcare. \n\nWyoming's providers are paramount to our way of life and these funds will equip them to continue in providing phenomenal care.",
